    .desc = { ent-BaseItem.desc }
ent-WirecutterCyber = wirecutter
    .desc = This kills the wire.
ent-WelderCyber = welding tool
    .desc = Melts anything as long as it's fueled, don't forget your eye protection!
ent-ProtokineticAcceleratorCyber = cyber protokinetic accelerator
    .desc = Fires low-damage kinetic bolts at a short range. The lack of stabilisation leads to decreased accuracy when firing in short succession.
ent-WeaponGrapplingGunCyber = cyber grappling gun
    .desc = { ent-BaseItem.desc }
ent-WeaponCrusherDaggerCyber = cyber crusher dagger
