    .desc = An arm-mounted scanner built to collect information on various anomalous objects.
ent-AutoinjectorCyber = autoinjector cybernetic arm attachment
    .desc = A sterile injector for rapid administration of drugs to patients.
ent-AutoinjectorCyberTricordrazine = tricordrazine cyber autoinjector
    .desc = A sterile injector for rapid administration of drugs to patients.
ent-AutoinjectorCyberInaprovaline = inaprovaline cyber autoinjector
    .desc = A sterile injector for rapid administration of drugs to patients.
ent-AdvancedJetInjectorCyber = cyber jet injector
    .desc = A pristine, fashionable, high quality injector. Now integrated into your arm!
ent-DefibrillatorCyber = cyber defibrillator
    .desc = Arm-mounted device that can save lives, and act as a weapon in a pinch.
ent-PowerCellTinyCyber = Cyber Defibrillator Battery Cell
    .desc = A tiny microreactor... Has some startup lag after use.
    .suffix = Full
ent-CyberEquipmentGrabber = riplet clamp
    .desc = Gives you the ability to carry things, like a tiny Ripley!
ent-CyberReagentGrinder = integrated reagent grinder
    .desc = From BlenderTech. Will It Blend? Let's find out!
    .suffix = grinder/juicer
ent-CyberToolMiniHoe = mini hoe cybernetic arm attachment
    .desc = It's used for removing weeds or scratching your back.
ent-CyberToolClippers = plant clippers cybernetic arm attachment
    .desc = A tool used to take samples from plants.
ent-CyberToolScythe = scythe cybernetic arm attachment
