ent-PrinterCyber = cybernetic printer
    .desc = The dream of every paperwork afficionado.
ent-PenCyber = cybernetic pen
    .desc = The pen of the future.
ent-StampCyber = cybernetic multistamp
    .desc = The bad boy can fit so many (3) stamps in it!
ent-HoloRestrainerCyber = holorestrainer
    .desc = Creates solid, but temporary holographic cuffs.
ent-HandcuffsHolographic = holocuffs
    .desc = { ent-Handcuffs.desc }
